PATCH 463: the c4df per-class RENDER methods for the mission view (STRSEG table 0x358a) -- arg-less dispatch
reads the published SI/DX, the writers' copy source is indexed by CLASSID*2, every writer's `clc` yields,
and the six un-decompiled table entries (c5e7/c5fc/c60f/c62f/c64a/c6a4 + the c91c builder) are added.

Trigger: with patch 462 the first class-4 effect object exists as a real record; its render method c694
(patch 424) read si/dx from the STALE __allregs params (c4df dispatches `call *gs:0x358a(bx)` arg-less), so
c945 copied word[garbage+0x276c] bytes from a garbage source over the display-list program at DGROUP:0x6c82
-> 22dd's cursor walked into a zero word -> icall(0) spin on the first frame (caught by a hardware
watchpoint on 0x6c88: writer c945 <- c694 <- c4df <- c33c <- 2471 <- 22dd).

ASM (0xc5c9-0xc6fa wrappers, 0xc8b2-0xc944 writers, 0xca2f/0xca6b headers): c4df leaves SI=object,
DL=byte[classid-0x1b74] (record code), BX=CX=classid*2; each wrapper loads BP/BX/DX per its own asm and
calls a builder; ca2f/ca6b do `mov bx,cx` so the builders' `add si,[bx-0x1b58]` indexes the per-CLASS
model-data offset table (patches 310/460 used the bx record field), `mov bx,dx; mov cx,[bx+0x276c]` gives
the byte count (dx = the record code -- every caller now passes g_fist_render_dx), and all builders end
`clc` -> c4df `jb c4df` falls through and RETURNS after one record so 2471 links exactly that node
(the C builders never cleared g_fist_cf -> c4df wrote every object's record in one call and 2471 linked
only the first).  ca2f's header word is AX as passed (ah=dl for the c962 family, an explicit value for
c8b2's callers -- patch 460 D3 forced dl).  New entries: c5e7 stc; c5fc (classes 0-3, the tanks) ->
c91c (kind 0x1e, xor-0x80 copy, [si+0x10]<->[si+0x26] swap); c60f (0x17 wrecks; dx=[si+0x1b], -1 ->
stc); c62f/c635 (7,0xf; needs byte[si+0x17]&1); c64a (0xb,0xe; heading flip +0x8000 around the record);
c6a4 (0x11; bp by byte[0xe6f1]).  The cockpit/map/external tables 0x3632/0x35fa/0x35c2 keep their
un-decompiled entries (c713/c715/c72e/c74d/c774/c77d/c783/c7a5/c817/c829/c82d/c845/c862/c86e/c874/c876/
c888/c894) -- not reached by self-play (d549=0x1c), next slice of this frontier.
